; 44-verbose.kurt

; `verbose` is a toggle (`verbose on` / `verbose off`) that makes Kurt print
; extra detail about *why* a match succeeded while it searches the theory:
; the expression it is trying to prove, and the formula it matched against.

bool A, B
use A implies B
use A

verbose on
B                    ; now prints the matching details as extra log lines
verbose off

B                    ; back to the terse "by ..." log line
